  "goodToKnow": "Restlos means completely or totally, with nothing left over: restlos ausverkauft (completely sold out), restlos begeistert (utterly thrilled), restlos aufklären (to clear up completely). Der Rest means remainder or leftovers: Der Rest ist Geschichte. Don't confuse it with rastlos (restless, from die Rast, rest). Synonyms: völlig, total, vollkommen."
